:name: Cortex-R8-Virtual-SMP
:description: This script is prepared to run Zephyr on a virtual dual-core Cortex-R8 board.

$name?="Cortex-R8-Virtual-SMP"

using sysbus
mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/cortex_r8_virtual_smp.repl

machine SetSerialExecution True

showAnalyzer uart0
cpu PerformanceInMips 50
cpu1 PerformanceInMips 50

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $elf
"""
runMacro $reset
